        "liquid_chQcV8": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ELORYA — Bloc HERO produit (note + titre + accroche + bénéfices + encadré bengkung)\n  ⚠️ CHIFFRES À VÉRIFIER AVANT MISE EN LIGNE → les 2 assign ci-dessous\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign elo_nota    = '4,8/5' -%}\n{%- assign elo_madres  = '6.000' -%}\n\n<style>\n  .elo-hero{\n    --elo-text:var(--elorya-text,#14140F);\n    --elo-body:var(--elorya-body,#3A3A34);\n    --elo-line:var(--elorya-line,#E6E6E2);\n    --elo-cream:var(--elorya-notice-bg,#FCF2E3);\n    --elo-star:var(--elorya-star,#EE7F2D);\n    --elo-green:var(--elorya-green,#2C4A35);\n    font-family:var(--elorya-font,'Montserrat',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif);\n    color:var(--elo-body);\n    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n  }\n  .elo-hero *{box-sizing:border-box}\n\n  /* ---------- 1. Barre note ---------- */\n  .elo-trust{\n    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\n    background:var(--elo-cream);border-radius:12px;\n    padding:9px 12px;margin:0 0 16px;\n  }\n  .elo-trust__pics{display:flex;flex-shrink:0}\n  .elo-trust__pics img{\n    width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;\n    border:2px solid #fff;margin-left:-9px;display:block;\n  }\n  .elo-trust__pics img:first-child{margin-left:0}\n  .elo-trust__txt{min-width:0}\n  .elo-trust__top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;line-height:1}\n  .elo-trust__stars{display:flex;gap:1px}\n  .elo-trust__stars svg{width:12px;height:12px;fill:var(--elo-star);display:block}\n  .elo-trust__note{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--elo-text);letter-spacing:-.01em}\n  .elo-trust__sub{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.35;margin-top:3px;color:var(--elo-body)}\n  .elo-trust__sub b{font-weight:700;color:var(--elo-text)}\n\n  /* ---------- 2. Titre ---------- */\n  .elo-hero__title{\n    font-size:22px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;\n    color:var(--elo-text);margin:0 0 12px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- 3. Accroche ---------- */\n  .elo-hero__lead{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65}\n  .elo-hero__lead p{margin:0 0 3px}\n  .elo-hero__lead p:last-child{margin:0}\n  .elo-hero__lead b{font-weight:700;color:var(--elo-text)}\n\n  /* ---------- 4. Bénéfices ---------- */\n  .elo-bullets{list-style:none;margin:0 0 18px;padding:0}\n  .elo-bullets li{\n    display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;\n    font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.45;padding:5px 0;\n  }\n  .elo-bullets svg{\n    width:17px;height:17px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;\n    stroke:var(--elo-text);fill:none;stroke-width:1.7;\n    stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;\n  }\n  .elo-bullets b{font-weight:700;color:var(--elo-text)}\n\n  /* ---------- 5. Encadré bengkung ---------- */\n  .elo-note{\n    display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:flex-start;\n    border:1px solid var(--elo-line);border-radius:14px;\n    padding:14px 14px;background:#fff;\n  }\n  .elo-note__ico{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}\n  .elo-note__ico svg{\n    width:22px;height:22px;stroke:var(--elo-green);fill:none;\n    stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;opacity:.85;\n  }\n  .elo-note__t{\n    font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;\n    color:var(--elo-text);margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em;\n  }\n  .elo-note__p{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}\n\n  /* ---------- Desktop ---------- */\n  @media (min-width:750px){\n    .elo-trust{padding:11px 16px;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px}\n    .elo-trust__pics img{width:32px;height:32px;margin-left:-10px}\n    .elo-trust__stars svg{width:13px;height:13px}\n    .elo-trust__note{font-size:14px}\n    .elo-trust__sub{font-size:12.5px}\n    .elo-hero__title{font-size:30px;margin-bottom:14px}\n    .elo-hero__lead{font-size:14.5px;margin-bottom:20px}\n    .elo-bullets li{font-size:14.5px;padding:6px 0}\n    .elo-bullets svg{width:18px;height:18px}\n    .elo-note{padding:16px 18px;gap:13px}\n    .elo-note__t{font-size:14.5px}\n    .elo-note__p{font-size:13.5px}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"elo-hero\">\n\n  {%- comment -%} ---------- Barre note ---------- {%- endcomment -%}\n  <div class=\"elo-trust\">\n    <div class=\"elo-trust__pics\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/262120138_5135161053168911_4317808011404363710_n_430x.jpg?v=1785806102\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/440963873_10228932907180188_5795405126749105216_n_430x.jpg?v=1785806102\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/70808168_2543092175756262_7125276819086901248_n_430x.jpg?v=1785806102\" alt=\"\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"elo-trust__txt\">\n      <div class=\"elo-trust__top\">\n        <div class=\"elo-trust__stars\">\n          {%- for i in (1..5) -%}\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14l-5-4.87 6.91-1.01L12 2z\"/></svg>\n          {%- endfor -%}\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"elo-trust__note\">{{ elo_nota }}</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"elo-trust__sub\"><b>Más de {{ elo_madres }} madres</b> ya confían en Elorya</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  {%- comment -%} ---------- Titre ---------- {%- endcomment -%}\n  <h1 class=\"elo-hero__title\">Braguita Moldeadora Post-Parto — Compresión 360°</h1>\n\n  {%- comment -%} ---------- Accroche ---------- {%- endcomment -%}\n  <div class=\"elo-hero__lead\">\n    <p>Tu tripa ha llevado <b>una vida</b> dentro durante <b>9 meses</b>.</p>\n    <p>Ahora merece que <b>la acompañen</b> — no que la aplasten.</p>\n    <p>Compresión circular <b>360°</b> inspirada en el <b>bengkung</b> malayo.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  {%- comment -%} ---------- Bénéfices ---------- {%- endcomment -%}\n  <ul class=\"elo-bullets\">\n    <li>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 5.5a1.5 1.5 0 100-3 1.5 1.5 0 000 3z\"/><path d=\"M4.5 8.5h15M12 8.5v6M12 14.5l-2.5 7M12 14.5l2.5 7\"/></svg>\n      <span>Tripa más <b>lisa</b> y <b>sujeta</b></span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 3l18 18\"/><path d=\"M10.6 5.1A9.7 9.7 0 0112 5c5 0 9 4.5 10 7-.4 1-1.5 2.6-3.1 4M6.2 6.6C4 8.1 2.4 10.2 2 12c1 2.5 5 7 10 7 1.5 0 2.9-.4 4.1-1\"/><path d=\"M9.9 9.9a3 3 0 004.2 4.2\"/></svg>\n      <span><b>Invisible</b> bajo la ropa</span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 11-3.4-7\"/><path d=\"M21 3.5V9h-5.5\"/></svg>\n      <span>Sujeción circular <b>360°</b></span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12.9 19.4l-.9.8-7.1-6.9A4.4 4.4 0 0112 7.3a4.4 4.4 0 017.1 5\"/><path d=\"M18.5 14v5M16 16.5h5\"/></svg>\n      <span>Compatible con <b>lactancia</b> y <b>cesárea</b></span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20.5 11.2A8.5 8.5 0 113.6 10\"/><path d=\"M12 7.5V12l2.8 1.7\"/><path d=\"M18.5 3v4M16.5 5h4\"/></svg>\n      <span>Diferencia visible en <b>2 o 3 semanas</b></span>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2.8l7.5 3v6c0 4.5-3.2 8.2-7.5 9.4-4.3-1.2-7.5-4.9-7.5-9.4v-6l7.5-3z\"/></svg>\n      <span><b>Satisfecha o te devolvemos el dinero</b> — 30 días</span>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n\n  {%- comment -%} ---------- Encadré bengkung ---------- {%- endcomment -%}\n  <div class=\"elo-note\">\n    <div class=\"elo-note__ico\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2.8l9 4.6-9 4.6-9-4.6 9-4.6z\"/><path d=\"M3 12.2l9 4.6 9-4.6\"/><path d=\"M3 16.6l9 4.6 9-4.6\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"elo-note__t\">El secreto de las madres malayas, el bengkung — desde hace 500 años</p>\n      <p class=\"elo-note__p\">Las fajas clásicas solo comprimen por delante. Tu cuerpo da toda la vuelta. Elorya también. Ahí está toda la diferencia.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>"
          }
        },
