      "settings": {
        "full_width": true,
        "remove_vertical_spacing": true,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": true,
        "liquid": "<div class=\"reviews-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"reviews-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"reviews-title\">What Women Are Saying</h2>\n    <div class=\"reviews-rating\">\n      <span class=\"reviews-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      <span class=\"reviews-count\">4.8 · 4,300+ Verified Reviews</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"reviews-slider\" id=\"reviewsSlider\">\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/39dff4d6-2220-466d-8812-df77f98d6da2_430x.png?v=1784762151\" alt=\"Customer review\" class=\"review-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"review-body\">\n        <div class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"review-text\">\"5'7\", ordered a Medium in the khaki. I put it on after my shower just to try it. Never took it off. Made dinner in it, ran to CVS in it, watched TV in it. My husband asked me twice if I was going somewhere. I was going to the couch. Already ordered the black.\"</p>\n        <div class=\"review-footer\">\n          <strong class=\"review-name\">Danielle R.</strong>\n          <span class=\"review-verified\">✓ Verified Purchase</span>\n          <span class=\"review-product\">Adjustable Back Dress · Khaki · Size M</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/ChatGPT_Image_23_juil._2026_00_14_13_430x.png?v=1784762087\" alt=\"Customer review\" class=\"review-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"review-body\">\n        <div class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"review-text\">\"I'm a size 8 and I was so worried it would look like a nightgown on me. It doesn't. The light blue is gorgeous and the back is the whole point. I adjust it closed when I go out and open it up at home. My boyfriend literally stopped talking mid-sentence the first time I wore it. Worth every penny.\"</p>\n        <div class=\"review-footer\">\n          <strong class=\"review-name\">Megan L.</strong>\n          <span class=\"review-verified\">✓ Verified Purchase</span>\n          <span class=\"review-product\">Adjustable Back Dress · Sky Blue · Size S</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/ChatGPT_Image_23_juil._2026_00_14_08_430x.png?v=1784762082\" alt=\"Customer review\" class=\"review-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"review-body\">\n        <div class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"review-text\">\"Wore this to a hotel dinner and got three compliments from strangers. Three. I had no makeup on, my hair was still wet from the pool, and I was barefoot in sandals. The black is not see-through at all, I checked in every mirror I could find. This is the only dress I packed for a five day trip and I regret nothing.\"</p>\n        <div class=\"review-footer\">\n          <strong class=\"review-name\">Nicole S.</strong>\n          <span class=\"review-verified\">✓ Verified Purchase</span>\n          <span class=\"review-product\">Adjustable Back Dress · Black · Size S</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/ChatGPT_Image_23_juil._2026_00_14_12_430x.png?v=1784762086\" alt=\"Customer review\" class=\"review-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"review-body\">\n        <div class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"review-text\">\"5'3\" and I got the short version. Finally a dress that doesn't drag on the floor or make me look like I'm drowning in fabric. It hits right below my knee which is perfect. Nothing touches my stomach, I can eat a full meal and nobody can tell. I've worn it four days out of the last seven. No shame.\"</p>\n        <div class=\"review-footer\">\n          <strong class=\"review-name\">Ashley K.</strong>\n          <span class=\"review-verified\">✓ Verified Purchase</span>\n          <span class=\"review-product\">Adjustable Back Dress · Black · Size M (Short)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/ChatGPT_Image_23_juil._2026_00_14_10_430x.png?v=1784762083\" alt=\"Customer review\" class=\"review-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"review-body\">\n        <div class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"review-text\">\"I'm a 12 and I was terrified this would make me look bigger. It doesn't. The fabric falls straight from the bust and just floats over everything else. My back looks amazing in it and my stomach is completely free. I haven't sucked in once this entire week. That alone is worth the price.\"</p>\n        <div class=\"review-footer\">\n          <strong class=\"review-name\">Rachel M.</strong>\n          <span class=\"review-verified\">✓ Verified Purchase</span>\n          <span class=\"review-product\">Adjustable Back Dress · Black · Size L (Short)</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"review-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/ChatGPT_Image_23_juil._2026_00_14_06_430x.png?v=1784762079\" alt=\"Customer review\" class=\"review-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"review-body\">\n        <div class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"review-text\">\"Size 20, 5'6\". I almost didn't order because every dress like this only shows size 4 models and I figured it would look completely different on me. It doesn't. It's loose in all the right places, the straps don't dig, and the back actually looks beautiful on a bigger body. I cried a little. Ordering two more colors.\"</p>\n        <div class=\"review-footer\">\n          <strong class=\"review-name\">Sandra J.</strong>\n          <span class=\"review-verified\">✓ Verified Purchase</span>\n          <span class=\"review-product\">Adjustable Back Dress · Black · Size XXL</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"reviews-dots\" id=\"reviewsDots\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.reviews-section {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  padding: 40px 0 32px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.reviews-header {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 0 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n.reviews-title {\n  font-size: clamp(26px, 5vw, 40px);\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n.reviews-rating {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n.reviews-stars {\n  color: #C4614A;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n}\n.reviews-count {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #555;\n}\n.reviews-slider {\n  display: flex;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n  scrollbar-width: none;\n  padding: 0 0 8px 0;\n}\n.reviews-slider::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n.reviews-slider::before,\n.reviews-slider::after {\n  content: '';\n  flex: 0 0 calc((100% - min(88vw, 480px)) / 2);\n}\n.review-card {\n  flex: 0 0 min(88vw, 480px);\n  scroll-snap-align: center;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #ede8e3;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n  margin: 0 8px;\n}\n.review-img {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 4/4;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  object-position: top;\n  display: block;\n}\n.review-body {\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n.review-stars {\n  color: #C4614A;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n.review-text {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-style: italic;\n  color: #444;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n.review-footer {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  border-top: 1px solid #f0ebe6;\n  padding-top: 12px;\n}\n.review-name {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #1a1a1a;\n}\n.review-verified {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #2e7d32;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n.review-product {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #aaa;\n  width: 100%;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n.reviews-dots {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  padding: 0 20px;\n}\n.reviews-dot {\n  width: 8px;\n  height: 8px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #ddd;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;\n  border: none;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n.reviews-dot.active {\n  background: #C4614A;\n  transform: scale(1.2);\n}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var slider = document.getElementById('reviewsSlider');\n  var dotsContainer = document.getElementById('reviewsDots');\n  var cards = slider.querySelectorAll('.review-card');\n  var dots = [];\n\n  cards.forEach(function(_, i) {\n    var dot = document.createElement('button');\n    dot.className = 'reviews-dot' + (i === 0 ? ' active' : '');\n    dot.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Review ' + (i + 1));\n    dot.addEventListener('click', function() {\n      var card = cards[i];\n      var sliderCenter = slider.offsetWidth / 2;\n      var cardCenter = card.offsetLeft + card.offsetWidth / 2;\n      slider.scrollTo({ left: cardCenter - sliderCenter, behavior: 'smooth' });\n    });\n    dotsContainer.appendChild(dot);\n    dots.push(dot);\n  });\n\n  slider.addEventListener('scroll', function() {\n    var sliderCenter = slider.scrollLeft + slider.offsetWidth / 2;\n    var closest = 0;\n    var minDist = Infinity;\n    cards.forEach(function(card, i) {\n      var dist = Math.abs(card.offsetLeft + card.offsetWidth / 2 - sliderCenter);\n      if (dist < minDist) { minDist = dist; closest = i; }\n    });\n    dots.forEach(function(d, i) {\n      d.classList.toggle('active', i === closest);\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>",
